{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49863","headline":"蝶恋花 一 · 冯延巳","name":"蝶恋花 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗外寒鸡天欲曙，香印成灰，坐起浑无绪。\n庭际高梧凝宿雾，卷帘双鹊惊飞去。\n屏上罗衣闲绣缕，一晌关情，忆遍江南路。\n夜夜梦魂休谩语，已知前事无情处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}